January 8, 2022 | https://www.cephalopod.studio/blog/build-an-app-on-ipad-with-swift-playgrounds-and-core-data | <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://www.cephalopod.studio/blog/build-an-app-on-ipad-with-swift-playgrounds-and-core-data">archive.org</a>
<br/><!-- hnss:readable-content --><hr/><div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div id="page" role="main">

          <article data-page-sections="5ff86ff260ca1365b35be75a" id="sections">

